class_name CrowArt
extends RefCounted

## **A crow, drawn in code** (task 0249): A048's master, flight, touchdown,
## peck and fall on its 32x24 canvas standing on (16,22), and its forecast
## head, through 0120's road until 0262 integrates the pack.
##
## Blue-black feathers (`ink_soft`, `night_light` underneath), cool `moon`
## highlights along the back so it reads on dark grass, a `stone` beak and a
## pale eye, facing west as A048 draws it - the view mirrors it to face east.
## **The flying exception**: the flight frames are drawn as if standing, the
## body fixed and only the wings moving, nothing on the pivot row or under;
## the view lifts the whole sprite and draws the shadow on the ground. The
## grounded frames - standing, landing, pecking and lying dead - stand their
## feet on row 21.
##
## Each frame is named for the runtime path A048 delivers it to, so the day
## the real art lands these load it and the drawings go. View only: where a
## crow is is `Enemies`'.

## Where A048 delivers them.
const DIR := "res://sprites/enemies/"
const HEAD_PATH := "res://sprites/ui/head_crow.png"

## What each letter of the maps below is drawn in.
